{1}{Worthless slags!  I don't know why we allow you to live...}{Worthless slags!  I don't know why we allow you to live...}{}{}{}{}
{2}{I've stepped in something foul Maug...  Get over here and lick my boots clean!}{I've stepped in something foul Maug...  Get over here and lick my boots clean!}{}{}{}{}
{3}{[pokes at ogre]  Does that bother you?  Perhaps you should do something about it?}{[pokes at ogre]  Does that bother you?  Perhaps you should do something about it?}{}{}{}{}
{4}{What a pathetic lot!  You bunch of overgrown abominations!}{What a pathetic lot!  You bunch of overgrown abominations!}{}{}{}{}
{5}{[kicks the ogre]  Ouch!  You've bruised my toe!  You will pay for that infraction, mongrel!}{[kicks the ogre]  Ouch!  You've bruised my toe!  You will pay for that infraction, mongrel!}{}{}{}{}
{6}{I bet you really wish to hit me, do you not?  You sniveling pathetic curs!}{I bet you really wish to hit me, do you not?  You sniveling pathetic curs!}{}{}{}{}
{7}{Impudent Lout!  Do not just stand there and grovel!}{Impudent Lout!  Do not just stand there and grovel!}{}{}{}{}
{8}{I can not believe that one of my intellect need concern himself with such fools!}{I can not believe that one of my intellect need concern himself with such fools!}{}{}{}{}
{9}{[kicks the ogre]  Do not look at me that way cur!  I am your Master!}{[kicks the ogre]  Do not look at me that way cur!  I am your Master!}{}{}{}{}
{10}{Aww...  Poor little ogres...  No body loves them...}{Aww...  Poor little ogres...  No body loves them...}{}{}{}{}
{11}{I see we are allowing all sorts of flotsam in these days...}{I see we are allowing all sorts of flotsam in these days...}{}{}{}{}
{12}{I have nothing to say to you!}{I have nothing to say to you!}{}{}{}{}
{13}{Ugh!  Such filth!  Get away from me!}{Ugh!  Such filth!  Get away from me!}{}{}{}{}
{14}{Stand in line with the rest of the slaves, fool!}{Stand in line with the rest of the slaves, fool!}{}{}{}{}
{15}{Leave me be!  ...unless you wish to become like these mongrels.}{Leave me be!  ...unless you wish to become like these mongrels.}{}{}{}{}
{16}{How dare you speak to me, base creature!}{How dare you speak to me, base creature!}{}{}{}{}
{17}{Impudent whelp!  You have no business addressing me!}{Impudent whelp!  You have no business addressing me!}{}{}{}{}
{18}{I see a lowly peon before me.  Do you wish to pay homage to my superior intellect?}{I see a lowly peon before me.  Do you wish to pay homage to my superior intellect?}{}{}{}{}
{19}{You are truly a stupid creature.}{You are truly a stupid creature.}{}{}{}{}
{20}{Do not bother me, insignificant one...}{Do not bother me, insignificant one...}{}{}{}{}

